---
layout: layouts/base.webc
title: "Projects"
---

<div class="relative flex flex-col gap-8 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-16 right-0 h-40 w-40 rounded-full bg-primary/20 blur-3xl motion-float"></div>
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-12 left-0 h-40 w-40 rounded-full bg-secondary/20 blur-3xl motion-float motion-delay-1"></div>

  <div class="space-y-3 motion-rise">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-black tracking-tight">Projects</h1>
    <p class="max-w-2xl text-base-content/70">
      Products I have shipped recently, from game experiments to practical tools
      that solve everyday problems.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <article class="group card border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-2xl hover:border-primary/30 motion-rise motion-delay-1">
      <figure class="bg-base-200/70 p-8">
        <img
          src="/images/my-bus-assistant-logo.svg"
          alt="My Bus Assistant logo"
          class="h-24 w-24 object-contain transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105"
        />
      </figure>
      <div class="card-body gap-4">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
          <h2 class="card-title text-2xl">My Bus Assistant</h2>
          <span class="badge badge-success badge-outline">Live</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-base-content/80">
          A fast Singapore bus-arrival web app with real-time data, smart search,
          favorites, nearby stops, and offline-friendly caching.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm">React 19</span>
          <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm">Hono</span>
          <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm">Bun</span>
          <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm">Turborepo</span>
          <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm">Tailwind CSS</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-actions mt-2 justify-end">
          <a
            href="https://github.com/minggliangg/my-bus-assistant"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="btn btn-outline btn-sm"
          >
            GitHub
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://my-bus-assistant.minggliangg.com/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="btn btn-primary btn-sm"
          >
            Live App
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="group card border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-2xl hover:border-primary/30 motion-rise motion-delay-2">
      <figure class="bg-base-200/70 p-8">
        <img
          src="/images/breakthrough.svg"
          alt="React Breakthrough logo"
          class="h-24 w-24 object-contain transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105"
        />
      </figure>
      <div class="card-body gap-4">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
          <h2 class="card-title text-2xl">React Breakthrough</h2>
          <span class="badge badge-success badge-outline">Live</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-base-content/80">
          A digital version of the abstract strategy game Breakthrough with
          drag-and-drop gameplay, board customization, themes, and responsive UX.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm">React 19</span>
          <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm">TypeScript</span>
          <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm">Vite</span>
          <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm">Tailwind CSS</span>
          <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm">@dnd-kit</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-actions mt-2 justify-end">
          <a
            href="https://github.com/minggliangg/react-breakthrough"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="btn btn-outline btn-sm"
          >
            GitHub
          </a>
          <a href="/react-breakthrough" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">
            Live Demo
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</div>
